{"bookInfo":{"bookId":"42000000541","bookName":"Entre las cenizas, despierta su dolor","cover":"https://thwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/4x2/42x0/420x0/42000001142/42000001142.jpg@w=360&h=640","viewCount":1204174,"followCount":34134,"introduction":" Alba, la hija biológica de los Lara, pasa un año en prisión después de que Lidia, la hija adoptada, le tienda una trampa. Cuando es liberada, toda su familia, incluido Elías, que aún es su prometido, siguen creyendo en las mentiras de Lidia y lastimándola. Para contentar a Lidia, Elías incluso accede a celebrar una boda falsa con ella. El día de su boda, Alba finge su propia muerte en un incendio y desaparece para siempre. ","chapterCount":56,"labels":["Family Bonds","Strong Female Lead"],"tags":["Family Bonds","Strong Female Lead"],"typeTwoIds":[703],"typeTwoNames":["Familia"],"typeTwoList":[{"id":703,"name":"Familia","replaceName":"familia"}],"language":"SPANISH","typeTwoName":"Familia","simpleLanguage":"es","bookNameEn":"Through-Ashes-Their-Sorrow-Awakens","bookNameLower":"through-ashes-their-sorrow-awakens","shelfTime":"2025-12-09 17:25:36","firstShelfTime":"2025-12-09 17:25:36","performerList":[{"performerId":"29128","performerName":"Brian O'Shea","performerFormatName":"Brian-O-Shea","performerAvatar":"https://hwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/8x2/29128/29128.jpg?time=1772617827036","videoCount":3},{"performerId":"12017","performerName":"Paige Marie Smeltzer","performerFormatName":"Paige-Marie-Smeltzer","performerAvatar":"https://hwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/7x1/12017/12017.jpg?time=1787724402853","videoCount":5},{"performerId":"12180","performerName":"Teig Sadhana","performerFormatName":"Teig-Sadhana","performerAvatar":"https://hwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/0x8/12180/12180.jpg?time=1772617825410","videoCount":4},{"performerId":"29265","performerName":"Tori Ellis","performerFormatName":"Tori-Ellis","performerAvatar":"https://hwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/5x6/292